  "content": "[Intro]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[G]Where is the sun,\n[D7]That shone\n[Em]on my head.\n[B]\n[C]The sun in my life,\n[G]It is dead,\n[D7]it is dead.\n[G]  [D7]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[G]Where is the light,\n[D7]That would play\n[Em]in my streets.\n[B]\n[C]And where are the friends,\n[G]I could meet,\n[D7]I could meet.\n[G]  [D7]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[G]Where are the girls,\n[D7]I\n[Em]left far be-\n[B]hind.\n[C]The spicks and the specks\n[G]Of the girls\n[D7]on my mind.\n[G]  [D7]\n\n[Verse 4]\n[G]Where is the sun\n[D7]That shone\n[Em]on my head.\n[B]\n[C]The sun in my life,\n[G]It is dead,\n[D7]it is dead.\n[G]  [D#7]\n\n[Verse 5]\n[G#]Where are the girls\n[D#7]That I\n[F]left far behind.\n[C]\n[C#]The spicks and the specks\n[G#]Of the girls\n[D#7]on my mind.\n[G#]  [E]\n\n[Verse 6]\n[A]Where are the girls\n[E7]I\n[F#m]left far behind.\n[C#]\n[D]The spicks and the specks\n[A]Of the girls\n[E7]on my mind.\n[A]\n\n[Bridge]\n[A]Where is the\n[E7]girl I\n[F#m]loved all\n[C#]along.\n[D]The girl\n[A]that I loved,\n[E7]She is gone, she is\n[A]gone.\n\n[Verse 7]\n[A]All of my life,\n[E7]I\n[F#m]call yesterday.\n[C#]\n[D]The spicks and the specks\n[A]Of my life\n[E7]gone away.\n[A]  [E]\n\n[Verse 8]\n[A]All of my\n[E7]life, I\n[F#m]call yesterday.\n[C#]\n[D]The spicks and the specks\n[A]Of my life\n[E7]gone away.\n[E][A]Everybody.\n\n[Outro]\n[A]\n[D]Spicks and specks!\n[A]\n[D]Spicks and specks!\n[A]\n[D]Spicks and specks!\n[A]\n[D]Spicks and specks!",
